repaired_gate=THM-2941(25f) gives max(Z)>13L/132;integer labels and first<floor(13L/132)+1 force some later label>=high_floor;the representative may be an exact high label or HIGH-TAIL
terminal_reduction=residual_bodies:69;zero_high_hostile_passes:4057;one_high_cases:7553;body_distinct_low_pairs:795;high_ray_recurrence_checks:3531712;minimum_two_high_gap:1438897/5584915336
cayley_alpha=G_d edges have nonzero difference-order<=7;R=max({r:r|d,2<=r<=7} union {1});cosets mod d/R are R-cliques and [0,d/R) is independent;therefore alpha(G_d)=d/R
pair_graph_boundary=every fixed-safe residue set has |S|>alpha=d/R;minimum_alpha_slack:1;the equality interval proves alpha sharp only for forcing a short-order pair;no pair is selected,hashed,or used
translated_band_gate=THM-2984 makes primitive-unit phases height-free and its complete-cell corollary is pointwise in the local coordinate;every translated strict high-danger band has length d/7 and contains at most ceil(d/7)<=alpha distinct residues;every terminal has |S|>alpha;minimum_band_slack:1;minimum_alpha_minus_ceil7:0;therefore every primitive direction and height has full projected section
